      "raw": "<p>Dandolo has the correct interpretation. Note that &quot;you&quot; is interpreted communally: the spirits as a whole pay that Energy cost in the usual way for choice events (including the aid by Fire).</p><p>It&#39;s worded the way it is because the costs are pooled. Eg, if you do damage in 2 lands, it costs 6 Energy; you can pay for that by Forgetting one card with Fire and discarding another. If the Energy costs were separate you wouldn&#39;t be able to do that, since you don&#39;t get change for overpaying for Events.</p><p>I updated the <a href=\"https://querki.net/u/darker/spirit-island-faq/#!.7w4g8qv\">relevant FAQ</a>, I hope that clarifies things.</p>",
